# Keep docs in sync

After meaningful changes under `react-native/` or `server/` (features, APIs, DSA demos, scripts, env, structure), follow the project skill:

`.cursor/skills/update-docs-on-code-change/SKILL.md`

Update README, AGENTS.md, env examples, and feature docs in the same session. Skip docs-only noise for tiny refactors with no contributor-facing impact.
